#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:63
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:64
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:455
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "Konfigurasi"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:122
msgid ""
"The saved key is hidden. Leave this as it is to keep it, or paste a "
"different key over it to replace it."
msgstr ""
"Kunci yang tersimpan disembunyikan. Biarkan apa adanya untuk "
"mempertahankannya, atau tempelkan kunci lain menimpanya untuk menggantinya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:215
msgid ""
"Save an API key and endpoint first, then this will show when that key "
"expires."
msgstr ""
"Simpan API Key dan endpoint dulu, lalu di sini akan muncul kapan kunci itu "
"kedaluwarsa."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:228
msgid ""
"This API key works, but the account has no access to that company — nothing "
"is syncing."
msgstr ""
"API Key ini berfungsi, tetapi akunnya tidak punya akses ke perusahaan "
"tersebut — tidak ada yang tersinkron."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:232
msgid ""
"Kledo accepted the key and then refused the request. Pasting a new key from "
"the same account will not help. Check that the account still belongs to the "
"company, or save a key made for the right company."
msgstr ""
"Kledo menerima kuncinya lalu menolak permintaannya. Menempelkan kunci baru "
"dari akun yang sama tidak akan menolong. Pastikan akun itu masih tergabung "
"di perusahaan tersebut, atau simpan kunci yang dibuat untuk perusahaan yang "
"benar."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:239
msgid "This API key is no longer valid — nothing is syncing."
msgstr "API Key ini sudah tidak berlaku — tidak ada yang tersinkron."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:243
msgid ""
"Kledo refused it. It has either expired or been replaced by a newer login. "
"Paste a current API key above and save."
msgstr ""
"Kledo menolaknya. Kunci ini sudah kedaluwarsa atau digantikan oleh login "
"yang lebih baru. Tempelkan API Key yang masih berlaku di atas lalu simpan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:253
msgid ""
"Kledo could not be reached for this, so the expiry date is unknown right "
"now. It will be retried automatically."
msgstr ""
"Kledo tidak dapat dihubungi untuk ini, jadi tanggal kedaluwarsanya belum "
"diketahui saat ini. Akan dicoba ulang otomatis."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:254
msgid "Not checked yet. Reload this page in a moment."
msgstr "Belum diperiksa. Muat ulang halaman ini sebentar lagi."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:263
msgid "State"
msgstr "Keadaan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:263
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktif"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:269
msgid ""
"Kledo renewed this key automatically, and the replacement is no longer the "
"key listed in Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Kledo memperpanjang kunci ini secara otomatis, dan penggantinya bukan lagi "
"kunci yang terdaftar di Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:271
msgid ""
"Syncing is unaffected, but managing the key from Kledo will not change what "
"this store uses. Create a new API key in Kledo and save it here if you want "
"the two to match again."
msgstr ""
"Sinkronisasi tidak terpengaruh, tetapi mengelola kunci dari Kledo tidak akan"
" mengubah kunci yang dipakai toko ini. Buat API Key baru di Kledo lalu "
"simpan di sini kalau Anda ingin keduanya cocok lagi."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:278
msgid "Name in Kledo"
msgstr "Nama di Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:285
