msgstr "Gudang"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:223
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-order.php:121
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Tag"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:238
msgid "Sales Order Link"
msgstr "Penautan Sales Order"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:240
msgid ""
"How an invoice relates back to the Kledo sales order the same WooCommerce "
"order already created. Both settings below are inert unless linking is on — "
"closing is something Kledo does to a sales order the invoice is attached to,"
" so there is nothing to close without the attachment."
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana sebuah invoice terhubung kembali ke sales order Kledo yang sudah "
"dibuat oleh order WooCommerce yang sama. Kedua pengaturan di bawah tidak "
"berpengaruh apa pun kalau penautan dimatikan — penutupan adalah tindakan "
"Kledo terhadap sales order yang invoice-nya menempel padanya, jadi tanpa "
"penautan tidak ada yang bisa ditutup."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:281
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:245
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:261
msgid "Link Invoice to Sales Order"
msgstr "Tautkan Tagihan ke Pesanan Penjualan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:249
msgid ""
"Record each invoice against the Kledo sales order it came from, so the sales"
" order counts those quantities as billed. Turn it off and the invoice stands"
" alone, leaving the sales order untouched — and the setting below stops "
"applying."
msgstr ""
"Catat setiap invoice ke sales order Kledo asalnya, sehingga sales order "
"tersebut menghitung kuantitasnya sebagai sudah ditagih. Matikan, dan invoice"
" berdiri sendiri tanpa menyentuh sales order — dan pengaturan di bawah "
"berhenti berlaku."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:282
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:254
msgid "Close Sales Order When Invoiced"
msgstr "Tutup Pesanan Penjualan Saat Ditagihkan"

#. translators: %s: the name of the setting this one depends on, wrapped in
#. <strong>.
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:260
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Requires %s above to be on; without it this setting does nothing. Kledo "
"closes a sales order once every quantity is billed — the same as invoicing "
"from the sales order in Kledo. Turn this off to close it yourself, though "
"Kledo closes it anyway the next time it recalculates that order."
msgstr ""
"Membutuhkan %s di atas dalam keadaan aktif; tanpa itu pengaturan ini tidak "
"melakukan apa-apa. Kledo menutup sebuah sales order begitu seluruh "
"kuantitasnya ditagih — sama seperti membuat invoice langsung dari sales "
"order di Kledo. Matikan ini kalau Anda ingin menutupnya sendiri, meskipun "
"Kledo tetap akan menutupnya saat berikutnya menghitung ulang order tersebut."

