#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:421
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: Kledo accepts this store's API key, but the account it belongs to has"
" no access to that company, so nothing is syncing. The key itself is fine — "
"pasting a new one from the same account will not help. Check that the "
"account still belongs to the company, or save a key made for the right "
"company in %s."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: Kledo menerima API Key toko ini, tetapi akun pemiliknya tidak punya "
"akses ke perusahaan tersebut, jadi tidak ada yang tersinkron. Kuncinya "
"sendiri tidak bermasalah — menempelkan kunci baru dari akun yang sama tidak "
"akan menolong. Pastikan akun itu masih tergabung di perusahaan tersebut, "
"atau simpan kunci yang dibuat untuk perusahaan yang benar di %s."

#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:433
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: this store's API key is no longer valid, so nothing is syncing to "
"Kledo right now. It has either expired or been replaced by a newer login. "
"Paste a current API key in %s."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: API Key toko ini sudah tidak berlaku, jadi saat ini tidak ada yang "
"tersinkron ke Kledo. Kunci ini sudah kedaluwarsa atau digantikan oleh login "
"yang lebih baru. Tempelkan API Key yang masih berlaku di %s."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:522
#: includes/class-wc-kledo.php:699
msgid "WooCommerce > Kledo > Configure"
msgstr "WooCommerce > Kledo > Configure"

#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:558
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo normally renews this key by itself while the store keeps syncing, so "
"no action is needed as long as orders are still reaching Kledo. If they are "
"not, the key will run out — and once it does, orders and invoices will stop "
"being sent to Kledo automatically until a current key is saved in %s."
msgstr ""
"Kledo biasanya memperbarui API Key ini secara otomatis selama toko masih "
"rutin melakukan sinkronisasi, jadi tidak ada yang perlu dilakukan selama "
"order masih sampai ke Kledo. Kalau tidak, masa berlaku API Key akan habis — "
"dan begitu itu terjadi, order dan invoice berhenti dikirim otomatis ke Kledo"
" sampai API Key yang masih berlaku disimpan di %s."

#. translators: %s: link to the plugin Configure screen
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:564
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This key does not renew itself. Once it expires, orders and invoices will "
"stop being sent to Kledo automatically and every sync will keep failing "
"until a current key is saved. Paste a current one in %s before then."
msgstr ""
"API Key ini tidak diperbarui secara otomatis. Begitu masa berlakunya habis, "
"order dan invoice berhenti dikirim otomatis ke Kledo dan setiap sinkronisasi"
" akan terus gagal sampai API Key yang masih berlaku disimpan. Tempelkan API "
"Key yang masih berlaku di %s sebelum tanggal tersebut."

#. translators: 1: number of days, 2: expiry date sentence, 3: what to do
#. about it
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:579
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: this store's API key expires in %1$d day. %2$s %3$s"
msgid_plural "Kledo: this store's API key expires in %1$d days. %2$s %3$s"
msgstr[0] "Kledo: API Key toko ini kedaluwarsa dalam %1$d hari. %2$s %3$s"
msgstr[1] "Kledo: API Key toko ini kedaluwarsa dalam %1$d hari. %2$s %3$s"

#. translators: %s: expiry date and time
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:613
#, php-format
msgid "It expires on %s."
msgstr "Kedaluwarsa pada %s."

