#: includes/class-wc-kledo-loader.php:321
#, php-format
msgid "WooCommerce Kledo requires %s to be installed and active."
msgstr "Diperlukan %s untuk menggunakan WooCommerce Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:186
msgid ""
"Kledo: stopped waiting for the Kledo order to close — the maximum wait time "
"was reached. Check the order in Kledo manually."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: berhenti menunggu pesanan Kledo tertutup — batas waktu tunggu "
"tercapai. Periksa pesanannya di Kledo secara manual."

#. translators: %d: number of attempts made
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:198
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: stopped waiting for the Kledo order to close after %d checks. Check "
"the order in Kledo manually."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: berhenti menunggu pesanan Kledo tertutup setelah %d kali pemeriksaan."
" Periksa pesanannya di Kledo secara manual."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:289
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Kledo: stopped waiting for the Kledo order to close — Kledo rejected the "
"status request (HTTP %d). Check the order in Kledo manually."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: berhenti menunggu pesanan Kledo tertutup — Kledo menolak permintaan "
"statusnya (HTTP %d). Periksa pesanannya di Kledo secara manual."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:312
msgid ""
"Kledo: the invoice exists in Kledo but there is no matching Kledo sales "
"order, so there is nothing to close. This is expected when \"Enable Create "
"Order\" is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: tagihannya ada di Kledo tetapi tidak ada pesanan penjualan Kledo yang"
" cocok, jadi tidak ada yang perlu ditutup. Ini wajar ketika \"Enable Create "
"Order\" dimatikan."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:322
msgid ""
"Kledo: the Kledo invoice was created without a link to the Kledo order, so "
"the order will not be closed automatically. This usually means the order "
"items changed between Processing and Completed. Close the order in Kledo "
"manually if needed."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: tagihan Kledo dibuat tanpa tautan ke pesanan Kledo, jadi pesanannya "
"tidak akan tertutup otomatis. Biasanya ini karena item pesanan berubah "
"antara Processing dan Completed. Tutup pesanannya di Kledo secara manual "
"bila perlu."

#. translators: %s: Kledo sales order reference number
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-order-closure.php:372
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo: sales order %s has been closed in Kledo (fully invoiced)."
msgstr ""
"Kledo: pesanan penjualan %s sudah ditutup di Kledo (seluruhnya tertagih)."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-woocommerce.php:213
msgid ""
"Kledo: API connection is disabled in plugin settings; sync was not "
