#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:273
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When an order is changed straight to Completed without going through "
"Processing, create its sales order in Kledo first, then send the invoice "
"once that sales order exists. Only applies while %s on the Order tab is on. "
"Turn this off if those orders should get an invoice only — it is then sent "
