msgid "Sync Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Sinkronisasi"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:215
msgid ""
"Sends orders that are not in Kledo yet — for example orders placed before "
"this plugin was installed. Only Processing and Completed orders are sent, "
"and only the parts switched on in the Order and Invoice tabs. Orders already"
" in Kledo are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Mengirim pesanan yang belum ada di Kledo — misalnya pesanan yang dibuat "
"sebelum plugin ini dipasang. Hanya pesanan Processing dan Completed yang "
"dikirim, dan hanya bagian yang diaktifkan di tab Pesanan dan Tagihan. "
"Pesanan yang sudah ada di Kledo dilewati."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:220
msgid "Orders From"
msgstr "Pesanan Dari Tanggal"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:224
msgid "Leave empty to start 30 days before today."
msgstr "Kosongkan untuk mulai dari 30 hari sebelum hari ini."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:229
msgid "Orders Until"
msgstr "Pesanan Sampai Tanggal"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:233
msgid "Leave empty to include today."
msgstr "Kosongkan untuk sampai hari ini."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:238
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:243
msgid ""
"How many orders are sent each minute. The next ones are only sent after "
"Kledo has finished creating these."
msgstr ""
"Berapa pesanan yang dikirim setiap menit. Pesanan berikutnya baru dikirim "
"setelah Kledo selesai membuat pesanan-pesanan ini."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:251
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:258
msgid "Send Automatically Every Day"
msgstr "Kirim Otomatis Setiap Hari"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:253
msgid ""
"What happens when this is switched on: every night the plugin looks at the "
"Processing and Completed orders of the last few days. Orders already in "
"Kledo are skipped, so nothing is created twice. Orders that are missing are "
"sent slowly, a few per minute. Invoices are created as paid or unpaid "
"following the Invoice tab. You can see the results in the Kledo Status tab, "
"and you will see a message if something failed."
msgstr ""
"Apa yang terjadi kalau ini dinyalakan? Setiap malam, plugin melihat pesanan "
"Processing dan Completed dari beberapa hari terakhir. Pesanan yang sudah ada "
"di Kledo dilewati, jadi tidak ada yang dibuat dua kali. Pesanan yang belum "
"ada dikirim pelan-pelan, beberapa pesanan per menit. Tagihan dibuat lunas "
"atau belum lunas mengikuti pengaturan di tab Tagihan. Hasilnya bisa dilihat "
"di tab Status Kledo, dan Anda akan melihat pemberitahuan kalau ada yang "
"gagal."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:262
msgid ""
"If ticked, every night the plugin looks for orders that are not in Kledo yet"
" and sends them by itself, slowly. You do not need to press any button. "
"Leave it unticked if you want to check first before anything is sent."
msgstr ""
"Kalau dicentang, setiap malam plugin akan mencari pesanan yang belum masuk "
"ke Kledo, lalu mengirimkannya sendiri pelan-pelan. Anda tidak perlu menekan "
"tombol apa pun. Biarkan tidak dicentang kalau Anda ingin memeriksa dulu "
"sebelum ada yang dikirim."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:267
msgid "Look Back"
msgstr "Periksa ke Belakang"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:276
msgid ""
"days. Only orders from this many days back are checked each night. Older "
"orders are not touched."
msgstr ""
"hari. Hanya pesanan dari sekian hari terakhir yang diperiksa setiap malam. "
"Pesanan yang lebih lama tidak akan disentuh."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:281
msgid "Start Time"
msgstr "Jam Mulai"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:286
msgid ""
"What time the check starts, in your store's timezone. Choose a quiet time "
"for your store."
msgstr ""
"Jam berapa pemeriksaan dimulai, menurut zona waktu toko Anda. Pilih jam saat"
" toko sedang sepi."

