msgstr ""
"Tagihan akan dibuat sebagai: %s (mengikuti pengaturan di tab Tagihan)."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:366
msgid ""
"Each transaction is dated with its order date, so reports of earlier months "
"in Kledo will change. Kledo does not refuse dates inside a period you have "
"locked (closed books), so make sure the range does not reach into one."
msgstr ""
"Setiap transaksi memakai tanggal pesanannya, jadi laporan bulan-bulan "
"sebelumnya di Kledo akan berubah. Kledo tidak menolak tanggal di periode "
"yang sudah dikunci (tutup buku), jadi pastikan rentang tanggal tidak masuk "
"ke periode itu."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-sync.php:367
msgid "Invoices reduce warehouse stock in Kledo on the order date."
msgstr "Tagihan akan mengurangi stok gudang di Kledo pada tanggal pesanan."

