#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:123
msgid "Also resend to Kledo and record what happens"
msgstr "Sekalian kirim ulang ke Kledo dan rekam prosesnya"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:126
msgid ""
"Only what Kledo does not have yet is resent, so nothing is created twice. "
"Leave this off to only check."
msgstr ""
"Hanya yang belum ada di Kledo yang dikirim ulang, jadi tidak ada yang dibuat"
" dua kali. Biarkan tidak dicentang kalau Anda hanya ingin memeriksa."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:132
msgid "Include full customer data in the report"
msgstr "Sertakan data pelanggan lengkap di laporan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:135
msgid ""
"Off by default: the customer's name, email, phone and address are partly "
"hidden. Turn on only when Kledo rejects the customer data itself."
msgstr ""
"Default tidak dicentang: nama, email, telepon, dan alamat pelanggan "
"disamarkan sebagian. Centang hanya kalau Kledo menolak data pelanggannya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:139
msgid "Run diagnosis"
msgstr "Jalankan diagnosa"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:142
msgid "The diagnosis needs JavaScript to run."
msgstr "Diagnosa membutuhkan JavaScript untuk berjalan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:165
msgid "Problems that only happen sometimes"
msgstr "Masalah yang hanya terjadi sesekali"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:167
msgid ""
"When orders only fail now and then, a diagnosis afterwards may find nothing "
"wrong. Record every request to Kledo for 24 hours instead; diagnoses run "
"during that time include what was recorded for the order. It switches itself"
" off after 24 hours. Customer data in the recording is partly hidden and the"
" API key is never recorded."
msgstr ""
"Kalau pesanan hanya gagal sesekali, diagnosa yang dijalankan belakangan bisa"
" saja tidak menemukan apa-apa. Untuk kasus seperti ini, rekam semua "
"pengiriman ke Kledo selama 24 jam; diagnosa yang dijalankan selama waktu itu"
" ikut menyertakan rekaman untuk pesanan tersebut. Rekaman berhenti sendiri "
"setelah 24 jam. Data pelanggan di rekaman disamarkan sebagian dan API key "
"tidak pernah direkam."

