"Run a diagnosis first, in the Diagnostics tab. It tells you the most likely "
"cause, and gives you a report to send us so we can help faster."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan diagnosa dulu di tab Diagnosa. Diagnosa memberi tahu kemungkinan "
"penyebabnya, dan menghasilkan laporan yang bisa Anda kirim ke kami supaya "
"kami bisa membantu lebih cepat."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-transactions.php:1023
