msgstr "Respons"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:418
msgid "The API connection is switched off in the Configure tab."
msgstr "\"Aktifkan Integrasi\" dimatikan di tab Konfigurasi."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:422
msgid "The API key or the API endpoint URL is empty."
msgstr "API key atau URL endpoint API masih kosong."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:431
msgid "Kledo refused the API key (HTTP 401)."
msgstr "Kledo menolak API key (HTTP 401)."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:435
msgid "Kledo could not be reached to check the API key."
msgstr "Kledo tidak bisa dihubungi untuk mengecek API key."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:441
msgid "Connected; Kledo accepts the API key."
msgstr "Terhubung; Kledo menerima API key."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:470
msgid "Both \"Enable Create Order\" and \"Enable Create Invoice\" are off."
msgstr ""
"\"Aktifkan Pembuatan Pesanan\" dan \"Aktifkan Pembuatan Tagihan\" sama-sama "
"mati."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:474
msgid ""
"Invoices are created as paid, but no payment account is chosen in the "
"Invoice tab."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan dibuat sebagai lunas, tetapi akun pembayaran belum dipilih di tab "
"Tagihan."

#. translators: 1: on/off, 2: on/off
#. translators: 1: present/absent, 2: present/absent
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:481
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:682
#, php-format
msgid "Sales order: %1$s · Invoice: %2$s"
msgstr "Pesanan penjualan: %1$s · Tagihan: %2$s"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:482
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:483
msgid "on"
msgstr "aktif"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:482
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:483
msgid "off"
msgstr "mati"

#. translators: 1: order status, 2: date
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:539
#, php-format
msgid "Status %1$s, created %2$s."
msgstr "Status %1$s, dibuat %2$s."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:545
msgid "Only Processing and Completed orders are sent to Kledo."
msgstr "Hanya pesanan Processing dan Completed yang dikirim ke Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:551
msgid ""
"The plugin never tried to send it — it most likely reached this status "
"before the plugin was installed or while it was inactive."
msgstr ""
"Plugin belum pernah mencoba mengirimnya — kemungkinan besar pesanan ini "
"sudah berstatus begini sebelum plugin dipasang, atau saat plugin sedang "
"nonaktif."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:584
msgid ""
"No product would be sent: the order has no products, or every product was "
"deleted from the store."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada produk yang akan dikirim: pesanan tidak punya produk, atau semua "
"produknya sudah dihapus dari toko."

#. translators: %d: number of order lines
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:588
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d order line(s) are skipped because their product was deleted from the "
"store."
msgstr "%d baris pesanan dilewati karena produknya sudah dihapus dari toko."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:595
#, php-format
msgid "Product \"%s\" has no SKU."
msgstr "Produk \"%s\" tidak punya SKU."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:600
#, php-format
msgid "Product \"%s\" has no regular price."
msgstr "Produk \"%s\" tidak punya harga normal."

#. translators: %d: number of products
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:615
#, php-format
msgid "%d product, data looks complete."
msgid_plural "%d products, data looks complete."
msgstr[0] "%d produk, data terlihat lengkap."
msgstr[1] "%d produk, data terlihat lengkap."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:632
msgid "Skipped: the plugin is not connected."
msgstr "Dilewati: plugin belum terhubung."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:646
#, php-format
msgid "Kledo did not answer the status request (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "Kledo tidak menjawab permintaan status (HTTP %d)."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:683
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:684
msgid "not in Kledo"
msgstr "tidak ada di Kledo"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:761
msgid "No failed sends on record."
msgstr "Tidak ada catatan pengiriman yang gagal."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:774
msgid "A send is held or failed; see the details."
msgstr "Ada pengiriman yang ditahan atau gagal; lihat detailnya."

#. translators: %d: number of overdue tasks
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:850
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d background task(s) are more than 15 minutes late — scheduled tasks are "
"not running on this site."
msgstr ""
"%d tugas latar belakang terlambat lebih dari 15 menit — tugas terjadwal "
"tidak berjalan di situs ini."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:856
msgid "Background tasks are running on time."
msgstr "Tugas latar belakang berjalan tepat waktu."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:873
msgid "Skipped: resending was not selected."
msgstr "Dilewati: kirim ulang tidak dipilih."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:879
msgid "Skipped: Kledo could not be read, so it is not safe to resend."
msgstr ""
"Dilewati: data di Kledo tidak bisa dibaca, jadi tidak aman untuk mengirim "
"ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:883
msgid "Skipped: everything this order needs is already in Kledo."
msgstr "Dilewati: semua yang dibutuhkan pesanan ini sudah ada di Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:931
msgid "Kledo did not accept the resend; see the recorded request below."
msgstr ""
"Kledo tidak menerima kiriman ulang; lihat rekaman pengirimannya di bawah."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:934
msgid ""
"Kledo accepted the resend. The next step checks whether it was created."
msgstr ""
"Kledo menerima kiriman ulang. Langkah berikutnya mengecek apakah sudah "
"dibuat."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:951
msgid "Skipped: nothing was resent."
msgstr "Dilewati: tidak ada yang dikirim ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:958
msgid "Kledo has now created everything that was resent."
msgstr "Kledo sudah membuat semua yang dikirim ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:963
msgid ""
"Kledo accepted the resend but has not created it yet. If it still is not "
"there in a few minutes, the problem is on Kledo's side — send this report to"
" Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Kledo menerima kiriman ulang tetapi belum membuatnya. Kalau beberapa menit "
"lagi masih belum ada, masalahnya ada di sisi Kledo — kirim laporan ini ke "
"Kledo."

#. translators: 1: why it went missing, 2: explanation of that cause
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:993
#, php-format
msgid "It is in Kledo now. Why it was missing: %1$s — %2$s"
msgstr "Sekarang sudah ada di Kledo. Kenapa sebelumnya tidak ada: %1$s — %2$s"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1046
msgid "The connection to Kledo is switched off"
msgstr "Koneksi ke Kledo dimatikan"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1048
msgid ""
"Switch it on in WooCommerce > Kledo > Configure, then resend the order."
msgstr ""
"Nyalakan \"Aktifkan Integrasi\" di WooCommerce > Kledo > Konfigurasi, lalu "
"kirim ulang pesanannya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1051
msgid "The plugin is not connected to Kledo"
msgstr "Plugin belum terhubung ke Kledo"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1052
msgid "The API key or the API endpoint URL is empty, so nothing can be sent."
msgstr ""
"API key atau URL endpoint API masih kosong, jadi tidak ada yang bisa "
"dikirim."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1053
msgid ""
"Fill in both in WooCommerce > Kledo > Configure, then resend the order."
msgstr ""
"Isi keduanya di WooCommerce > Kledo > Konfigurasi, lalu kirim ulang "
"pesanannya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1056
msgid "Kledo refuses the API key"
msgstr "Kledo menolak API key"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1057
msgid ""
"The saved API key has expired, was revoked, or belongs to an account that no"
" longer has access to the company."
msgstr ""
"API key yang tersimpan sudah kedaluwarsa, sudah dicabut, atau milik akun "
"yang tidak lagi punya akses ke perusahaan."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1058
msgid ""
"Create a new API key in Kledo, save it in WooCommerce > Kledo > Configure, "
"then resend."
msgstr ""
"Buat API key baru di Kledo, simpan di WooCommerce > Kledo > Konfigurasi, "
"lalu kirim ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1061
msgid "Another plugin changes the requests to Kledo"
msgstr "Plugin lain mengubah pengiriman ke Kledo"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1062
msgid ""
"Kledo only accepts requests that identify themselves as this plugin, and "
"another plugin or the server rewrote that identification (the User-Agent), "
"so Kledo refuses them."
msgstr ""
"Kledo hanya menerima pengiriman yang mengenalkan diri sebagai plugin ini, "
"tetapi plugin lain atau server mengubah identitas itu (User-Agent), sehingga"
" Kledo menolaknya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1063
msgid ""
"Send this report to Kledo; it shows the changed value. Usually a security or"
" performance plugin that rewrites outgoing requests has to be configured to "
"leave them alone."
msgstr ""
"Kirim laporan ini ke Kledo; laporan menunjukkan nilai yang diubah. Biasanya "
"plugin keamanan atau performa yang mengubah pengiriman keluar perlu diatur "
"supaya tidak menyentuhnya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1066
msgid "The store cannot reach Kledo"
msgstr "Toko tidak bisa menghubungi Kledo"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1067
msgid ""
"The request did not get an answer — the server may block outgoing "
"connections, or there was a network, DNS or SSL problem."
msgstr ""
"Pengiriman tidak mendapat jawaban — server mungkin memblokir koneksi keluar,"
" atau ada masalah jaringan, DNS, atau SSL."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1068
msgid ""
"Ask your hosting provider whether outgoing connections to the Kledo API are "
"allowed, then resend."
msgstr ""
"Tanyakan ke penyedia hosting Anda apakah koneksi keluar ke API Kledo "
"diizinkan, lalu kirim ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1071
msgid "Creating transactions is switched off"
msgstr "Pembuatan transaksi dimatikan"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1072
msgid ""
"Both \"Enable Create Order\" and \"Enable Create Invoice\" are off, so "
"nothing is sent."
msgstr ""
"\"Aktifkan Pembuatan Pesanan\" dan \"Aktifkan Pembuatan Tagihan\" sama-sama "
"mati, jadi tidak ada yang dikirim."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1073
msgid "Switch on what you need in the Order and Invoice tabs."
msgstr "Nyalakan yang Anda butuhkan di tab Pesanan dan Tagihan."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1076
msgid "The order status does not send anything"
msgstr "Status pesanan ini tidak mengirim apa pun"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1077
msgid ""
"Only Processing orders get a sales order and only Completed orders get an "
"invoice. This order has another status."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan penjualan hanya dibuat untuk pesanan Processing, dan tagihan hanya "
"untuk pesanan Completed. Pesanan ini statusnya lain."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1078
msgid "Change the order to Processing or Completed when it is ready."
msgstr "Ubah status pesanan ke Processing atau Completed kalau sudah siap."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1081
msgid "The plugin never saw this order"
msgstr "Plugin belum pernah melihat pesanan ini"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1082
msgid ""
"The order reached Processing or Completed before the plugin was installed, "
"or while it was inactive, so it was never sent."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan ini sudah berstatus Processing atau Completed sebelum plugin "
"dipasang, atau saat plugin nonaktif, jadi belum pernah dikirim."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1083
msgid ""
"Send it with \"Kledo: Send sales order / invoice\" in the order actions, or "
"send many at once from the Sync tab."
msgstr ""
"Kirim lewat aksi pesanan \"Kledo: Kirim pesanan penjualan (manual pertama)\""
" atau tagihan, atau kirim banyak sekaligus dari tab Sinkronisasi."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1086
msgid "Products are missing from the order"
msgstr "Ada produk yang hilang dari pesanan"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1087
msgid ""
"Some or all products of this order were deleted from the store, so they "
"cannot be sent."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian atau semua produk pesanan ini sudah dihapus dari toko, jadi tidak "
"bisa dikirim."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1088
msgid "Restore the products or create the transaction in Kledo manually."
msgstr "Kembalikan produknya, atau buat transaksinya secara manual di Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1091
msgid "Kledo rejected the data"
msgstr "Kledo menolak datanya"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1092
msgid ""
"Kledo refused the order because something in it is not valid in Kledo — the "
"error message in the report says what."
msgstr ""
"Kledo menolak pesanan karena ada data yang tidak valid di Kledo — pesan "
"error di laporan menyebutkan apa."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1093
msgid ""
"Correct what the error names (product, customer, account, warehouse), then "
"resend."
msgstr ""
"Perbaiki yang disebut di pesan error (produk, pelanggan, akun, gudang), lalu"
" kirim ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1096
msgid "Too many requests at once"
msgstr "Terlalu banyak pengiriman sekaligus"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1097
msgid "Kledo asked the store to slow down."
msgstr "Kledo meminta toko memperlambat pengiriman."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1098
msgid "Wait a few minutes; the plugin retries automatically."
msgstr "Tunggu beberapa menit; plugin akan mencoba lagi secara otomatis."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1101
msgid "No payment account is chosen"
msgstr "Akun pembayaran belum dipilih"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1102
msgid ""
"Invoices are created as paid, but there is no account to record the payment "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan dibuat sebagai lunas, tetapi tidak ada akun untuk mencatat "
"pembayarannya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1103
msgid "Choose a Payment Account in the Invoice tab, then resend."
msgstr "Pilih Akun Pembayaran di tab Tagihan, lalu kirim ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1106
msgid "Scheduled tasks are not running on this site"
msgstr "Tugas terjadwal tidak berjalan di situs ini"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1107
msgid ""
"Retries and checks are done by WordPress scheduled tasks (WP-Cron), and they"
" are not running, so failed sends are never retried."
msgstr ""
"Percobaan ulang dan pengecekan dijalankan oleh tugas terjadwal WordPress "
"(WP-Cron), dan tugas itu tidak berjalan, sehingga pengiriman yang gagal "
"tidak pernah dicoba lagi."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1108
msgid ""
"Ask your hosting provider to enable WP-Cron or a real cron job for "
"WordPress. Meanwhile, resend from the Kledo Status tab."
msgstr ""
"Minta penyedia hosting Anda menyalakan WP-Cron atau cron job untuk "
"WordPress. Sementara itu, kirim ulang dari tab Status Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1111
msgid "Kledo accepted the order but could not create it"
msgstr "Kledo menerima pesanan tetapi gagal membuatnya"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1112
msgid ""
"The store sent it correctly, but creating it failed inside Kledo. The reason"
" is only recorded on Kledo's side."
msgstr ""
"Toko sudah mengirimnya dengan benar, tetapi pembuatannya gagal di dalam "
"Kledo. Alasannya hanya tercatat di sisi Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1113
msgid ""
"Send this report to Kledo; it contains what the Kledo team needs to find the"
" reason."
msgstr ""
"Kirim laporan ini ke Kledo; isinya sudah mencakup yang dibutuhkan tim Kledo "
"untuk mencari penyebabnya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1116
msgid "Sending failed"
msgstr "Pengiriman gagal"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1117
msgid "The request to Kledo failed; the error message in the report says how."
msgstr "Pengiriman ke Kledo gagal; pesan error di laporan menjelaskan kenapa."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1118
msgid ""
"Resend from the Kledo Status tab. If it keeps failing, send this report to "
"Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Kirim ulang dari tab Status Kledo. Kalau terus gagal, kirim laporan ini ke "
"Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1121
msgid "The invoice is waiting for its sales order"
msgstr "Tagihan menunggu pesanan penjualannya"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1122
msgid ""
"The invoice is held until the sales order exists in Kledo, so the two can be"
" linked. It is sent automatically."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan ditahan sampai pesanan penjualannya ada di Kledo, supaya keduanya "
"bisa ditautkan. Tagihan dikirim otomatis."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1123
msgid ""
"Nothing to do unless it is still waiting after an hour; then check the sales"
" order."
msgstr ""
"Tidak perlu melakukan apa pun, kecuali masih menunggu setelah satu jam; "
"kalau begitu, periksa pesanan penjualannya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1126
msgid "Kledo is still creating it"
msgstr "Kledo masih membuatnya"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1127
msgid "Kledo accepted the order and has not finished creating it yet."
msgstr "Kledo sudah menerima pesanan dan belum selesai membuatnya."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1128
msgid ""
"Check again in a few minutes. If it is still not there after an hour, send "
"this report to Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Cek lagi beberapa menit lagi. Kalau setelah satu jam masih belum ada, kirim "
"laporan ini ke Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1131
msgid "Fixed by resending"
msgstr "Sudah diperbaiki dengan mengirim ulang"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1132
msgid "The order was missing in Kledo and is there now after the resend."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan sebelumnya tidak ada di Kledo, dan sekarang sudah ada setelah "
"dikirim ulang."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1133
msgid ""
"Nothing more to do. If this keeps happening, send this report to Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Tidak perlu melakukan apa-apa lagi. Kalau ini terus terjadi, kirim laporan "
"ini ke Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1136
msgid "Everything is already in Kledo"
msgstr "Semua sudah ada di Kledo"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1137
msgid "Kledo holds everything this order should have."
msgstr "Semua yang seharusnya ada untuk pesanan ini sudah ada di Kledo."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1138
msgid ""
"If you do not see it in Kledo, search for the reference numbers shown in "
"step 6."
msgstr ""
"Kalau Anda tidak melihatnya di Kledo, cari nomor referensi yang ditampilkan "
"di langkah 6."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1141
msgid "No cause could be found from the store"
msgstr "Penyebab tidak ditemukan dari sisi toko"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1142
msgid "Every check on the store side passed."
msgstr "Semua pemeriksaan di sisi toko lolos."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1143
msgid "Send this report to Kledo for investigation."
msgstr "Kirim laporan ini ke Kledo untuk diselidiki."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1169
msgid ""
"Log files are not available on this store (WooCommerce may be logging to the"
" database)."
msgstr ""
"File log tidak tersedia di toko ini (WooCommerce mungkin menyimpan log di "
"database)."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:413
msgid "Copy the new key."
msgstr "Salin API key yang baru."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:414
msgid ""
"Paste it into the API Key field below and click \"Save changes\". Orders "
"keep syncing automatically from then on."
msgstr ""
"Tempel di kolom API Key di bawah, lalu klik \"Simpan perubahan\". Setelah "
"itu pesanan tetap tersinkron otomatis."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:418
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:250
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:506
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:453
msgid "Create a new API key in Kledo"
msgstr "Buat API key baru di Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:419
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:187
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(terbuka di tab baru)"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:421
msgid "Go to the API Key field"
msgstr "Ke kolom API Key"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:477
msgid ""
"The API key's account has no access to this company — nothing is syncing"
msgstr ""
"Akun pemilik API key tidak punya akses ke perusahaan ini — tidak ada yang "
"tersinkron"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:478
msgid ""
"Kledo accepts the key, but the account it belongs to no longer has access to"
" the company. Check the account in Kledo, or create a key while logged in to"
" the right company."
msgstr ""
"Kledo menerima key-nya, tetapi akun pemiliknya sudah tidak punya akses ke "
"perusahaan ini. Periksa akunnya di Kledo, atau buat key baru saat login di "
"perusahaan yang benar."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:484
msgid "The API key is no longer valid — nothing is syncing"
msgstr "API key sudah tidak berlaku — tidak ada yang tersinkron"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:485
msgid ""
"Kledo refused the saved key: it has expired or was replaced. Orders and "
"invoices are not reaching Kledo until a new key is saved."
msgstr ""
"Kledo menolak key yang tersimpan: sudah kedaluwarsa atau sudah diganti. "
"Pesanan dan tagihan tidak akan masuk ke Kledo sampai key baru disimpan."

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:501
#, php-format
msgid "The API key expires in %d day"
msgid_plural "The API key expires in %d days"
msgstr[0] "API key kedaluwarsa dalam %d hari"
msgstr[1] "API key kedaluwarsa dalam %d hari"

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:506
msgid ""
"Kledo normally renews it by itself while orders keep syncing. If orders are "
"not reaching Kledo, create a new key now so syncing does not stop."
msgstr ""
"Biasanya Kledo memperpanjang key ini sendiri selama pesanan terus "
"tersinkron. Kalau pesanan tidak masuk ke Kledo, buat key baru sekarang "
"supaya sinkronisasi tidak berhenti."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-connection-status.php:507
msgid ""
"This key does not renew itself. Create a new key before it expires, so "
"orders and invoices keep reaching Kledo automatically."
msgstr ""
"Key ini tidak diperpanjang otomatis. Buat key baru sebelum kedaluwarsa, "
"supaya pesanan dan tagihan tetap masuk ke Kledo otomatis."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:481
msgid "Guide for this tab"
msgstr "Panduan untuk tab ini"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:601
msgid "Kledo: Guide & FAQ"
msgstr "Kledo: Panduan & FAQ"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:36
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:37
msgid "Guide & FAQ"
msgstr "Panduan & FAQ"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:77
msgid ""
"Everything about using this plugin, in the order you need it: connect to "
"Kledo, choose what is created, see what reached Kledo, send what did not, "
"and find out why an order is missing. Click a topic to open it, or search "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Semua tentang cara memakai plugin ini, berurutan sesuai kebutuhan: "
"menghubungkan ke Kledo, memilih apa yang dibuat, melihat apa yang sudah "
"masuk ke Kledo, mengirim yang belum, dan mencari tahu kenapa sebuah pesanan "
"tidak masuk. Klik topik untuk membukanya, atau cari di bawah."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:81
msgid "Search the guide"
msgstr "Cari di panduan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:82
msgid "Search, e.g. API key, invoice, old orders…"
msgstr "Cari, misalnya: API key, tagihan, pesanan lama…"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:83
msgid "Nothing found. Try another word, or ask Kledo in the Support tab."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ditemukan. Coba kata lain, atau tanyakan ke Kledo lewat tab Bantuan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:86
msgid "Guide contents"
msgstr "Isi panduan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:90
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:145
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:93
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "Panduan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:158
msgid ""
"Still stuck? Run a diagnosis in the Diagnostics tab and send the report to "
"Kledo from the Support tab."
msgstr ""
"Masih bingung? Jalankan diagnosa di tab Diagnosa, lalu kirim laporannya ke "
"Kledo lewat tab Bantuan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:218
msgid "How the plugin works"
msgstr "Cara kerja plugin"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:219
msgid ""
"The plugin creates transactions in Kledo from your WooCommerce orders, by "
"itself, when an order reaches the right status:"
msgstr ""
"Plugin membuat transaksi di Kledo dari pesanan WooCommerce Anda, secara "
"otomatis, saat pesanan mencapai status tertentu:"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:221
msgid "Order status in WooCommerce"
msgstr "Status pesanan di WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:221
msgid "Created in Kledo"
msgstr "Yang dibuat di Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:223
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "Processing"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:223
msgid "A sales order (if \"Enable Create Order\" is on)"
msgstr "Pesanan penjualan (kalau \"Aktifkan Pembuatan Pesanan\" menyala)"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:224
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Completed"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:224
msgid "An invoice (if \"Enable Create Invoice\" is on), linked to the sales order"
msgstr ""
"Tagihan (kalau \"Aktifkan Pembuatan Tagihan\" menyala), ditautkan ke pesanan"
" penjualannya"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:225
msgid "Any other status"
msgstr "Status lainnya"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:225
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:229
msgid ""
"Kledo first queues what it receives and creates it a moment later, so the "
"plugin checks back with Kledo until it finds the transaction. That is why "
"you see \"Waiting for Kledo\" before \"In Kledo\"."
msgstr ""
"Kledo memasukkan dulu kiriman ke antrean dan baru membuatnya beberapa saat "
"kemudian, jadi plugin mengecek ulang ke Kledo sampai transaksinya ditemukan."
" Karena itu Anda akan melihat \"Menunggu Kledo\" sebelum \"Ada di Kledo\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:230
msgid ""
"If something fails, the plugin retries by itself. Anything that still did "
"not arrive can be sent again from the order, the order list, the Kledo "
"Status tab, or the Sync tab."
msgstr ""
"Kalau ada yang gagal, plugin mencoba lagi sendiri. Yang tetap belum masuk "
"bisa dikirim ulang dari halaman pesanan, daftar pesanan, tab Status Kledo, "
"atau tab Sinkronisasi."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:235
msgid "Create an API key in Kledo and connect"
msgstr "Buat API key di Kledo dan hubungkan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:236
msgid ""
"The API key is how this store logs in to your Kledo company. Without it "
"nothing is sent."
msgstr ""
"API key adalah cara toko ini masuk ke perusahaan Anda di Kledo. Tanpa API "
"key, tidak ada yang dikirim."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:238
msgid ""
"Log in to Kledo with an account that has access to the company you want to "
"send orders to."
msgstr ""
"Login ke Kledo dengan akun yang punya akses ke perusahaan tujuan pengiriman "
"pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:240
msgid "Create a new API key for WooCommerce and copy it."
msgstr "Buat API key baru untuk WooCommerce, lalu salin."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:241
msgid "In this plugin, open the Configure tab and tick \"Enable Integration\"."
msgstr "Di plugin ini, buka tab Konfigurasi dan centang \"Aktifkan Integrasi\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:242
msgid ""
"Paste the key into \"API Key\" and fill in \"API Endpoint URL\" with the API"
" address Kledo gives for your company. Ask Kledo support if you do not know "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Tempel key di kolom \"API Key\", lalu isi \"API Endpoint URL\" dengan alamat"
" API perusahaan Anda dari Kledo. Tanyakan ke tim Kledo kalau Anda tidak tahu"
" alamatnya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:243
msgid ""
"Click \"Save changes\". \"API Key Status\" then shows the key's name, when "
"it was last used, and when it expires."
msgstr ""
"Klik \"Simpan perubahan\". \"Status API Key\" lalu menampilkan nama key, "
"kapan terakhir dipakai, dan kapan kedaluwarsa."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:246
msgid ""
"After saving, the key is shown masked: only the company name and the last "
"four characters. To replace it, paste a new key over it."
msgstr ""
"Setelah disimpan, key ditampilkan tersamar: hanya nama perusahaan dan empat "
"karakter terakhir. Untuk menggantinya, tempel key baru di atasnya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:247
msgid ""
"From 30 days before the key expires, a message appears in the admin and a "
"banner on the Configure tab with a button to create a new key. Replace it "
"before it expires so syncing never stops."
msgstr ""
"Mulai 30 hari sebelum key kedaluwarsa, muncul pemberitahuan di admin dan "
"banner di tab Konfigurasi dengan tombol untuk membuat key baru. Ganti "
"sebelum kedaluwarsa supaya sinkronisasi tidak pernah berhenti."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:251
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:507
msgid "Open the Configure tab"
msgstr "Buka tab Konfigurasi"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:256
msgid "Set up sales orders"
msgstr "Atur pesanan penjualan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:257
msgid "A sales order is created in Kledo when an order becomes Processing."
msgstr "Pesanan penjualan dibuat di Kledo saat pesanan berstatus Processing."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:259
msgid "Open the Order tab."
msgstr "Buka tab Pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:260
msgid ""
"Tick \"Enable Create Order\" if you want sales orders in Kledo. Leave it off"
" if you only want invoices."
msgstr ""
"Centang \"Aktifkan Pembuatan Pesanan\" kalau Anda ingin pesanan penjualan "
"dibuat di Kledo. Biarkan mati kalau Anda hanya butuh tagihan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:261
msgid ""
"Set the \"Order Prefix\" (the start of the Kledo number, for example "
"WC/SO/), the \"Warehouse\" the stock comes from, and the \"Tags\" to put on "
"each sales order."
msgstr ""
"Atur \"Awalan Nomor Pesanan\" (awal nomor di Kledo, misalnya WC/SO/), "
"\"Gudang\" asal stok, dan \"Tag\" untuk setiap pesanan penjualan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:262
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:383
msgid "Click \"Save changes\"."
msgstr "Klik \"Simpan perubahan\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:265
msgid "Open the Order tab"
msgstr "Buka tab Pesanan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:270
msgid "Set up invoices"
msgstr "Atur tagihan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:271
msgid "An invoice is created in Kledo when an order becomes Completed."
msgstr "Tagihan dibuat di Kledo saat pesanan berstatus Completed."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:273
msgid "Open the Invoice tab and tick \"Enable Create Invoice\"."
msgstr "Buka tab Tagihan dan centang \"Aktifkan Pembuatan Tagihan\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:274
msgid ""
"Set the \"Invoice Prefix\", and choose whether invoices are created as Paid "
"or Unpaid. For Paid, also choose the \"Payment Account\" the payment is "
"recorded on."
msgstr ""
"Atur \"Awalan Nomor Tagihan\", lalu pilih apakah tagihan dibuat Lunas atau "
"Belum Dibayar. Kalau Lunas, pilih juga \"Akun Pembayaran\" untuk mencatat "
"pembayarannya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:275
msgid "Choose the \"Warehouse\" and the \"Tags\"."
msgstr "Pilih \"Gudang\" dan \"Tag\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:276
msgid ""
"Check the sales order link settings below (all on by default), then click "
"\"Save changes\"."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pengaturan tautan pesanan penjualan di bawahnya (semuanya menyala "
"secara default), lalu klik \"Simpan perubahan\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:279
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:279
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "Fungsinya"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:281
msgid ""
"The invoice is attached to its sales order, so the sales order counts those "
"items as invoiced."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan ditautkan ke pesanan penjualannya, sehingga pesanan penjualan "
"menghitung barang-barang itu sebagai sudah ditagihkan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:282
msgid "Kledo closes the sales order as soon as everything on it is invoiced."
msgstr "Kledo menutup pesanan penjualan begitu semua isinya sudah ditagihkan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:283
msgid ""
"An order changed straight to Completed still gets its sales order first, "
"then its invoice. Turn off to send only the invoice for such orders."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan yang langsung diubah ke Completed tetap dibuatkan pesanan penjualan "
"dulu, lalu tagihannya. Matikan kalau pesanan seperti itu cukup dikirim "
"tagihannya saja."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:287
msgid ""
"The invoice due date is the day the order was completed, or one month after "
"the order date if it has no completion date."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal jatuh tempo tagihan adalah tanggal pesanan diselesaikan, atau satu "
"bulan setelah tanggal pesanan kalau tidak ada tanggal selesai."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:290
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:479
msgid "Open the Invoice tab"
msgstr "Buka tab Tagihan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:295
msgid "Check what reached Kledo"
msgstr "Cek apa yang sudah masuk ke Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:296
msgid ""
"The Kledo column in the WooCommerce order list shows two lines per order — "
"the sales order and the invoice — each with one of these statuses:"
msgstr ""
"Kolom Kledo di daftar pesanan WooCommerce menampilkan dua baris per pesanan "
"— pesanan penjualan dan tagihan — masing-masing dengan salah satu status "
"ini:"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:298
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:298
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Arti"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:302
msgid "Hover over a status to see the Kledo reference number."
msgstr "Arahkan kursor ke status untuk melihat nomor transaksinya di Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:303
msgid ""
"The same statuses are used in the Kledo Status tab, the Sync tab and the "
"Kledo box on the order page."
msgstr ""
"Status yang sama dipakai di tab Status Kledo, tab Sinkronisasi, dan kotak "
"Kledo di halaman pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:306
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:336
msgid "Open the order list"
msgstr "Buka daftar pesanan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:311
msgid "Send or check one order"
msgstr "Kirim atau cek satu pesanan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:312
msgid ""
"Open the order in WooCommerce. The Kledo box on the right shows the status "
"of its sales order and invoice in Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Buka pesanannya di WooCommerce. Kotak Kledo di sebelah kanan menampilkan "
"status pesanan penjualan dan tagihannya di Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:314
msgid ""
"To send it: in \"Order actions\", choose \"Kledo: Send sales order (first "
"manual)\" or \"Kledo: Send invoice (first manual)\", then click the arrow "
"button. The Kledo box also has send buttons."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengirim: di \"Order actions\", pilih \"Kledo: Kirim pesanan penjualan"
" (manual pertama)\" atau \"Kirim tagihan ke Kledo (manual pertama)\", lalu "
"klik tombol panah. Kotak Kledo juga punya tombol kirim."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:315
msgid ""
"To check it: choose \"Kledo: Check Kledo status now\" in \"Order actions\". "
"The result appears at the top of the page and in the order notes."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengecek: pilih \"Kledo: Periksa status Kledo sekarang\" di \"Order "
"actions\". Hasilnya muncul di atas halaman dan di catatan pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:316
msgid ""
"If it is still missing: click \"Not in Kledo? Diagnose this order\" in the "
"Kledo box."
msgstr ""
"Kalau masih belum ada: klik \"Tidak ada di Kledo? Diagnosa pesanan ini\" di "
"kotak Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:319
msgid ""
"\"Re-send\" appears for something already sent and may create a duplicate in"
" Kledo — use it only if you are sure it is not in Kledo."
msgstr ""
"\"Kirim ulang\" muncul untuk yang sudah pernah dikirim dan bisa membuat "
"duplikat di Kledo — pakai hanya kalau Anda yakin transaksinya tidak ada di "
"Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:324
msgid "Find and send many orders from the order list"
msgstr "Cari dan kirim banyak pesanan dari daftar pesanan"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:326
msgid "Open WooCommerce › Orders."
msgstr "Buka WooCommerce › Pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:327
msgid ""
"Use the filters: \"Kledo sales order\" and \"Kledo invoice\" (Not sent, "
"Waiting for Kledo, In Kledo, Failed) and the order date range \"From … to "
"…\". You can combine them with the order status."
msgstr ""
"Pakai filternya: \"Pesanan penjualan Kledo\" dan \"Tagihan Kledo\" (Belum "
"dikirim, Menunggu Kledo, Ada di Kledo, Gagal) serta rentang tanggal pesanan "
"\"Dari … sampai …\". Bisa digabung dengan status pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:328
msgid ""
"Click \"Filter\", tick the orders (or all of them), choose \"Kledo: Send "
"sales order\", \"Kledo: Send invoice\" or \"Kledo: Check status in Kledo\" "
"in \"Bulk actions\", and click \"Apply\"."
msgstr ""
"Klik \"Filter\", centang pesanannya (atau semuanya), pilih \"Kledo: Kirim "
"pesanan penjualan\", \"Kledo: Kirim tagihan\", atau \"Kledo: Cek status di "
"Kledo\" di \"Aksi massal\", lalu klik \"Terapkan\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:331
msgid ""
"Example: status Completed, Kledo invoice \"Not sent\", dates 15 to 17 "
"October → every completed order of those days whose invoice is not in Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Contoh: status Completed, Tagihan Kledo \"Belum dikirim\", tanggal 15 sampai"
" 17 Oktober → semua pesanan selesai di tanggal itu yang tagihannya belum ada"
" di Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:332
msgid ""
"Up to 20 orders are sent per click, and anything already in Kledo is "
"skipped. For more, use the \"Send all of them gradually with Sync\" button "
"that appears next to the filters."
msgstr ""
"Maksimal 20 pesanan per klik, dan yang sudah ada di Kledo dilewati. Untuk "
"lebih banyak, pakai tombol \"Kirim semuanya bertahap lewat Sinkronisasi\" "
"yang muncul di samping filter."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:333
msgid ""
"The date range replaces the \"All dates\" month filter when you fill it in."
msgstr "Rentang tanggal menggantikan filter bulan \"All dates\" kalau diisi."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:341
msgid "The Kledo Status tab"
msgstr "Tab Status Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:342
msgid ""
"Every sales order and invoice the plugin sent, with its status in Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Semua pesanan penjualan dan tagihan yang pernah dikirim plugin, beserta "
"statusnya di Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:344
msgid ""
"The cards at the top count what is in Kledo, waiting, needs attention, and "
"was not sent. Click a card to see those orders."
msgstr ""
"Kartu di bagian atas menghitung yang sudah ada di Kledo, sedang menunggu, "
"perlu tindakan, dan belum dikirim. Klik kartu untuk melihat pesanannya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:345
msgid ""
"Use the tabs (Waiting for Kledo, In Kledo, Send failed, Rejected by Kledo, "
"Failed in Kledo) and the filters for type, order dates and order number."
msgstr ""
"Pakai tab statusnya (Menunggu Kledo, Ada di Kledo, Gagal kirim, Ditolak "
"Kledo, Gagal di Kledo) dan filter jenis, tanggal pesanan, serta nomor "
"pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:346
msgid ""
"Under each order number: \"Check status\" and \"Resend\" work without "
"reloading the page; \"Diagnose\" opens the Diagnostics tab for that order."
msgstr ""
"Di bawah setiap nomor pesanan: \"Cek status\" dan \"Kirim ulang\" berjalan "
"tanpa memuat ulang halaman; \"Diagnosa\" membuka tab Diagnosa untuk pesanan "
"itu."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:347
msgid ""
"To act on many rows: tick them, choose \"Resend selected (failed only)\" or "
"\"Check status in Kledo\", and click \"Apply\"."
msgstr ""
"Untuk banyak baris sekaligus: centang barisnya, pilih \"Kirim ulang yang "
"dipilih (hanya yang gagal)\" atau \"Cek status di Kledo\", lalu klik "
"\"Terapkan\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:350
msgid ""
"The \"Notes\" column says what went wrong and what to do. Open \"What do the"
" statuses mean?\" for an explanation of every status."
msgstr ""
"Kolom \"Keterangan\" menjelaskan apa yang salah dan apa yang perlu "
"dilakukan. Buka \"Apa arti setiap status?\" untuk penjelasan semua status."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:351
msgid ""
"Screen Options (top right) shows or hides the Transaction, Attempts and "
"Notes columns."
msgstr ""
"Screen Options (kanan atas) bisa menampilkan atau menyembunyikan kolom "
"Transaksi, Percobaan, dan Keterangan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:354
msgid "Open the Kledo Status tab"
msgstr "Buka tab Status Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:359
msgid "Send old or missed orders (Sync tab)"
msgstr "Kirim pesanan lama atau yang terlewat (tab Sinkronisasi)"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:360
msgid ""
"For orders that were placed before the plugin was installed, or that were "
"missed. Nothing is sent until you start it."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pesanan dari sebelum plugin dipasang, atau yang terlewat. Tidak ada "
"yang dikirim sampai Anda memulainya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:362
msgid ""
"Open the Sync tab. Choose the order dates (empty means the last 30 days) and"
" click \"Count again\" to see how many orders need sending."
msgstr ""
"Buka tab Sinkronisasi. Pilih tanggal pesanannya (kosong = 30 hari terakhir),"
" lalu klik \"Hitung ulang\" untuk melihat berapa pesanan yang perlu dikirim."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:363
msgid ""
"Check the list below: \"Only orders that need sending\" shows exactly what "
"will be sent."
msgstr ""
"Periksa daftar di bawahnya: \"Hanya pesanan yang perlu dikirim\" menampilkan"
" persis apa yang akan dikirim."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:364
msgid "Click \"Process gradually\" and read the confirmation before accepting."
msgstr "Klik \"Proses bertahap\" dan baca konfirmasinya sebelum menyetujui."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:365
msgid ""
"Watch the progress, or leave the page — it continues in the background. Use "
"Pause, Resume or Cancel at any time."
msgstr ""
"Pantau prosesnya, atau tinggalkan halaman — prosesnya tetap berjalan di "
"latar belakang. Gunakan Jeda, Lanjutkan, atau Batalkan kapan saja."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:368
msgid ""
"Orders are sent 5 to 10 per minute (\"Speed\"), and the next ones only after"
" Kledo has created the previous ones. Orders already in Kledo are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan dikirim 5 sampai 10 per menit (\"Kecepatan\"), dan pesanan "
"berikutnya baru dikirim setelah Kledo selesai membuat yang sebelumnya. "
"Pesanan yang sudah ada di Kledo dilewati."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:369
msgid ""
"Each transaction gets its order date, so reports of earlier months in Kledo "
"change, and invoices reduce warehouse stock on that date. Kledo does not "
"refuse dates inside a period you closed (locked), so do not choose dates "
"inside one."
msgstr ""
"Setiap transaksi memakai tanggal pesanannya, jadi laporan bulan-bulan "
"sebelumnya di Kledo akan berubah, dan tagihan mengurangi stok gudang pada "
"tanggal itu. Kledo tidak menolak tanggal di periode yang sudah ditutup "
"(dikunci), jadi jangan memilih tanggal di periode tersebut."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:370
msgid ""
"If Kledo has not finished a batch after 30 minutes, the sync pauses itself; "
"resume it once Kledo works normally again."
msgstr ""
"Kalau Kledo belum menyelesaikan satu batch setelah 30 menit, sinkronisasi "
"dijeda otomatis; lanjutkan lagi setelah Kledo kembali normal."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:373
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:389
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:473
msgid "Open the Sync tab"
msgstr "Buka tab Sinkronisasi"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:378
msgid "Send missed orders automatically every night"
msgstr "Kirim pesanan yang terlewat secara otomatis setiap malam"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:379
msgid ""
"Optional, off by default. When on, every night the plugin looks for orders "
"of the last few days that are not in Kledo yet, and sends them by itself, "
"slowly."
msgstr ""
"Opsional, mati secara default. Kalau dinyalakan, setiap malam plugin mencari"
" pesanan beberapa hari terakhir yang belum ada di Kledo, lalu mengirimkannya"
" sendiri pelan-pelan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:381
msgid "Open the Sync tab and tick \"Send Automatically Every Day\"."
msgstr "Buka tab Sinkronisasi dan centang \"Kirim Otomatis Setiap Hari\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:382
msgid ""
"Choose how many days back to look (\"Look Back\", 7 by default) and the "
"\"Start Time\" (a quiet hour for your store)."
msgstr ""
"Pilih berapa hari ke belakang (\"Periksa ke Belakang\", default 7) dan \"Jam"
" Mulai\" (jam saat toko sepi)."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:386
msgid ""
"You see a message only if something failed. Results are in the Kledo Status "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"Pemberitahuan hanya muncul kalau ada yang gagal. Hasilnya bisa dilihat di "
"tab Status Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:394
msgid "An order did not reach Kledo — find out why"
msgstr "Pesanan tidak masuk ke Kledo — cari tahu penyebabnya"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:396
msgid ""
"Open the Diagnostics tab (or click \"Diagnose\" in the Kledo Status tab or "
"on the order page)."
msgstr ""
"Buka tab Diagnosa (atau klik \"Diagnosa\" di tab Status Kledo atau di "
"halaman pesanan)."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:398
msgid "Read \"Likely cause\" and \"What to do\" at the end, and follow it."
msgstr ""
"Baca \"Kemungkinan penyebab\" dan \"Yang bisa dilakukan\" di bagian akhir, "
"lalu ikuti."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:399
msgid ""
"To try again at once, tick \"Also resend to Kledo and record what happens\" "
"before running. Only what Kledo does not have yet is resent."
msgstr ""
"Untuk langsung mencoba lagi, centang \"Sekalian kirim ulang ke Kledo dan "
"rekam prosesnya\" sebelum menjalankan. Hanya yang belum ada di Kledo yang "
"dikirim ulang."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:403
msgid ""
"For problems that only happen now and then, click \"Record for 24 hours\", "
"wait until it happens again, then run a diagnosis for that order."
msgstr ""
"Untuk masalah yang hanya terjadi sesekali, klik \"Rekam selama 24 jam\", "
"tunggu sampai terjadi lagi, lalu jalankan diagnosa untuk pesanan itu."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:404
msgid ""
"The report never contains your API key, and customer details are partly "
"hidden unless you choose otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Laporan tidak pernah berisi API key Anda, dan data pelanggan disamarkan "
"sebagian kecuali Anda memilih sebaliknya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:407
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:452
msgid "Open the Diagnostics tab"
msgstr "Buka tab Diagnosa"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:412
msgid "Automatic retries and scheduled tasks"
msgstr "Percobaan ulang otomatis dan tugas terjadwal"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:414
msgid ""
"A failed send is retried by itself: after about 5 minutes, then less and "
"less often up to every 8 hours, for up to two days."
msgstr ""
"Pengiriman yang gagal dicoba ulang sendiri: sekitar 5 menit kemudian, lalu "
"makin jarang sampai setiap 8 jam, hingga dua hari."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:415
msgid ""
"Data that Kledo rejected is not retried, because it would be rejected again."
" Fix the data, then resend."
msgstr ""
"Data yang ditolak Kledo tidak dicoba ulang, karena pasti ditolak lagi. "
"Perbaiki datanya, lalu kirim ulang."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:416
msgid ""
"Retries, checks and the Sync tab run on WordPress scheduled tasks (WP-Cron)."
" If your host blocks them, the work also runs when an administrator opens "
"wp-admin, but a real cron job is better — ask your hosting provider."
msgstr ""
"Percobaan ulang, pengecekan, dan tab Sinkronisasi berjalan di tugas "
"terjadwal WordPress (WP-Cron). Kalau hosting Anda memblokirnya, pekerjaannya"
" tetap berjalan saat administrator membuka wp-admin, tetapi cron job "
"sungguhan lebih baik — tanyakan ke penyedia hosting Anda."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:417
msgid ""
"Everything the plugin does is written to WooCommerce › Status › Logs, source"
" \"wc-kledo\", and important results to the order notes."
msgstr ""
"Semua yang dilakukan plugin dicatat di WooCommerce › Status › Logs dengan "
"source \"wc-kledo\", dan hasil pentingnya di catatan pesanan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:450
msgid "An order is not in Kledo. What should I do?"
msgstr "Ada pesanan yang tidak ada di Kledo. Apa yang harus saya lakukan?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:451
msgid ""
"Run a diagnosis for it in the Diagnostics tab. It tells you the likely cause"
" and what to do, and can resend it. If that does not help, send the report "
"to Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan diagnosa untuk pesanan itu di tab Diagnosa. Diagnosa memberi tahu "
"kemungkinan penyebab dan yang perlu dilakukan, dan bisa sekalian mengirim "
"ulang. Kalau tidak membantu, kirim laporannya ke Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:456
msgid "What does \"Failed in Kledo\" mean?"
msgstr "Apa arti \"Gagal di Kledo\"?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:457
msgid ""
"Kledo accepted the order but never created it — the problem happened inside "
"Kledo. It is not resent by itself, so a slow Kledo cannot cause duplicates. "
"Resend it; if it fails again, run a diagnosis and send the report to Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Kledo sudah menerima pesanan tetapi tidak pernah membuatnya — masalahnya "
"terjadi di dalam Kledo. Pesanan ini tidak dikirim ulang otomatis, supaya "
"Kledo yang lambat tidak menimbulkan duplikat. Kirim ulang; kalau gagal lagi,"
" jalankan diagnosa dan kirim laporannya ke Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:461
msgid "An order has been \"Waiting for Kledo\" for a long time. Is that normal?"
msgstr "Pesanan sudah lama berstatus \"Menunggu Kledo\". Apakah itu normal?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:462
msgid ""
"Usually it turns into \"In Kledo\" within minutes. The plugin keeps checking"
" for about 6 hours; if it never appears, the status becomes \"Failed in "
"Kledo\". You can also click \"Check status\" to ask right away."
msgstr ""
"Biasanya berubah menjadi \"Ada di Kledo\" dalam beberapa menit. Plugin terus"
" mengecek selama sekitar 6 jam; kalau tidak pernah muncul, statusnya menjadi"
" \"Gagal di Kledo\". Anda juga bisa klik \"Cek status\" untuk langsung "
"menanyakannya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:466
msgid "Can an order be created twice in Kledo?"
msgstr "Apakah pesanan bisa terbuat dua kali di Kledo?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:467
msgid ""
"The plugin avoids it: bulk actions, the Sync tab and the diagnosis only send"
" what Kledo does not have yet, and Kledo recognises an order it already has "
"by its WooCommerce order number. Only \"Re-send\" on the order page sends "
"again on purpose. A transaction you created by hand in Kledo with a "
"different number is not recognised."
msgstr ""
"Plugin mencegahnya: aksi massal, tab Sinkronisasi, dan diagnosa hanya "
"mengirim yang belum ada di Kledo, dan Kledo mengenali pesanan yang sudah ada"
" lewat nomor pesanan WooCommerce-nya. Hanya \"Kirim ulang\" di halaman "
"pesanan yang sengaja mengirim lagi. Transaksi yang Anda buat manual di Kledo"
" dengan nomor lain tidak dikenali."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:471
msgid ""
"Does the plugin send my old orders by itself after I install or update it?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah plugin mengirim pesanan lama saya secara otomatis setelah dipasang "
"atau di-update?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:472
msgid ""
"No. It only counts the orders of the last 30 days that are not in Kledo and "
"shows a message. Nothing is sent until you press \"Process gradually\" in "
"the Sync tab, or switch on \"Send Automatically Every Day\"."
msgstr ""
"Tidak. Plugin hanya menghitung pesanan 30 hari terakhir yang belum ada di "
"Kledo lalu menampilkan pemberitahuan. Tidak ada yang dikirim sampai Anda "
"menekan \"Proses bertahap\" di tab Sinkronisasi, atau menyalakan \"Kirim "
"Otomatis Setiap Hari\"."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:477
msgid ""
"I changed an order straight to Completed. Is the sales order still created?"
msgstr ""
"Saya mengubah pesanan langsung ke Completed. Apakah pesanan penjualannya "
"tetap dibuat?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:478
msgid ""
"Yes, by default: the sales order is created first, and the invoice follows "
"once the sales order is in Kledo. To send only the invoice for such orders, "
"turn off \"Create Sales Order First When an Order Skips Processing\" in the "
"Invoice tab."
msgstr ""
"Ya, secara default: pesanan penjualan dibuat dulu, lalu tagihannya menyusul "
"setelah pesanan penjualan ada di Kledo. Untuk mengirim tagihannya saja, "
"matikan \"Buat Pesanan Penjualan Dulu Jika Pesanan Langsung Selesai\" di tab"
" Tagihan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:483
msgid "Why is an invoice \"Waiting for sales order\"?"
msgstr "Kenapa tagihan berstatus \"Menunggu pesanan penjualan\"?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:484
msgid ""
"With \"Link Invoice to Sales Order\" on, the invoice is only sent once its "
"sales order exists in Kledo, so the two can be linked. It is sent by itself "
"as soon as the sales order is there."
msgstr ""
"Kalau \"Tautkan Tagihan ke Pesanan Penjualan\" menyala, tagihan baru dikirim"
" setelah pesanan penjualannya ada di Kledo, supaya keduanya bisa ditautkan. "
"Tagihan dikirim sendiri begitu pesanan penjualannya ada."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:488
msgid ""
"I edited, cancelled or refunded an order after it was sent. Does Kledo "
"update?"
msgstr ""
"Saya mengedit, membatalkan, atau me-refund pesanan setelah dikirim. Apakah "
"Kledo ikut berubah?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:489
msgid ""
"No. The plugin only creates transactions when an order becomes Processing or"
" Completed; it does not change or delete them afterwards. Adjust the "
"transaction in Kledo yourself."
msgstr ""
"Tidak. Plugin hanya membuat transaksi saat pesanan menjadi Processing atau "
"Completed; setelah itu plugin tidak mengubah atau menghapusnya. Sesuaikan "
"transaksinya sendiri di Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:493
msgid "What data is sent to Kledo?"
msgstr "Data apa saja yang dikirim ke Kledo?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:494
msgid ""
"The customer's name, email, phone and address; the order number and date; "
"each product's name, SKU, description, quantity, price and photo link; "
"shipping cost, discount and whether tax applies; the warehouse, tags and "
"payment settings you chose; and shipment tracking when WooCommerce Shipment "
"Tracking is used."
msgstr ""
"Nama, email, telepon, dan alamat pelanggan; nomor dan tanggal pesanan; nama,"
" SKU, deskripsi, jumlah, harga, dan link foto setiap produk; ongkos kirim, "
"diskon, dan ada tidaknya pajak; gudang, tag, dan pengaturan pembayaran yang "
"Anda pilih; serta data resi pengiriman kalau memakai WooCommerce Shipment "
"Tracking."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:498
msgid "How are my products matched in Kledo?"
msgstr "Bagaimana produk saya dicocokkan di Kledo?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:499
msgid ""
"Each product is sent with its name and SKU. Give every product a SKU so "
"Kledo can recognise it. Products deleted from the store cannot be sent; the "
"diagnosis warns about missing SKUs and deleted products."
msgstr ""
"Setiap produk dikirim dengan nama dan SKU-nya. Beri setiap produk SKU supaya"
" Kledo bisa mengenalinya. Produk yang sudah dihapus dari toko tidak bisa "
"dikirim; diagnosa memberi peringatan untuk produk tanpa SKU dan produk yang "
"terhapus."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:503
msgid "My API key is about to expire. What now?"
msgstr "API key saya akan kedaluwarsa. Apa yang harus dilakukan?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:504
msgid ""
"Click \"Create a new API key in Kledo\" in the message or on the Configure "
"tab, create the key, paste it into \"API Key\" and click \"Save changes\". "
"Do it before the expiry date; after it, nothing reaches Kledo until a new "
"key is saved."
msgstr ""
"Klik \"Buat API key baru di Kledo\" di pemberitahuan atau di tab "
"Konfigurasi, buat key-nya, tempel di \"API Key\", lalu klik \"Simpan "
"perubahan\". Lakukan sebelum tanggal kedaluwarsa; setelah lewat, tidak ada "
"yang masuk ke Kledo sampai key baru disimpan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:512
msgid "The plugin says Kledo refuses my API key."
msgstr "Plugin bilang Kledo menolak API key saya."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:513
msgid ""
"The key has expired or was replaced, or the account behind it lost access to"
" the company. Create a new key while logged in to the right company in "
"Kledo, and save it in the Configure tab."
msgstr ""
"Key-nya sudah kedaluwarsa atau sudah diganti, atau akun pemiliknya "
"kehilangan akses ke perusahaan. Buat key baru saat login di perusahaan yang "
"benar di Kledo, lalu simpan di tab Konfigurasi."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:517
msgid "How do I stop sending to Kledo for a while?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara menghentikan pengiriman ke Kledo untuk sementara?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:518
msgid ""
"Untick \"Enable Integration\" in the Configure tab. Orders that change "
"status meanwhile are not sent; send them later from the Sync tab."
msgstr ""
"Hapus centang \"Aktifkan Integrasi\" di tab Konfigurasi. Pesanan yang "
"berubah status selama itu tidak dikirim; kirim nanti lewat tab Sinkronisasi."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:522
msgid "What happens if I deactivate or delete the plugin?"
msgstr "Apa yang terjadi kalau plugin dinonaktifkan atau dihapus?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:523
msgid ""
"Deactivating stops sending and pauses a running sync; your settings and "
"history stay, and everything continues when you activate it again. "
"Transactions already in Kledo are never removed."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan plugin menghentikan pengiriman dan menjeda sinkronisasi yang "
"sedang berjalan; pengaturan dan riwayat tetap tersimpan, dan semuanya "
"berlanjut saat plugin diaktifkan lagi. Transaksi yang sudah ada di Kledo "
"tidak pernah dihapus."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:527
msgid "Retries never seem to happen."
msgstr "Percobaan ulang sepertinya tidak pernah berjalan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:528
msgid ""
"WordPress scheduled tasks (WP-Cron) are probably not running on your host. "
"The diagnosis checks this (\"Queues and scheduled tasks\"). Ask your hosting"
" provider to enable WP-Cron or a real cron job."
msgstr ""
"Kemungkinan tugas terjadwal WordPress (WP-Cron) tidak berjalan di hosting "
"Anda. Diagnosa memeriksa hal ini (\"Antrean dan tugas terjadwal\"). Minta "
"penyedia hosting menyalakan WP-Cron atau cron job sungguhan."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:532
msgid "Where can I see what the plugin did?"
msgstr "Di mana saya bisa melihat apa yang dilakukan plugin?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:533
msgid ""
"In the order notes of each order, in the Kledo Status tab, and in "
"WooCommerce › Status › Logs (source \"wc-kledo\"; \"wc-kledo-debug\" while "
"recording for 24 hours)."
msgstr ""
"Di catatan setiap pesanan, di tab Status Kledo, dan di WooCommerce › Status "
"› Logs (source \"wc-kledo\"; \"wc-kledo-debug\" selama perekaman 24 jam)."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:534
msgid "Open the logs"
msgstr "Buka log"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:538
msgid "Is there a faster way to open these tabs?"
msgstr "Apakah ada cara cepat membuka tab-tab ini?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:539
msgid ""
"Yes. On WordPress 6.9 and later, press Ctrl+K (Cmd+K on a Mac) anywhere in "
"wp-admin and type \"kledo\". The Plugins screen also has a \"Settings\" link"
" under Kledo."
msgstr ""
"Ada. Di WordPress 6.9 ke atas, tekan Ctrl+K (Cmd+K di Mac) di halaman wp-"
"admin mana saja lalu ketik \"kledo\". Halaman Plugins juga punya link "
"\"Settings\" di bawah Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-support.php:50
msgid "How do I use the plugin?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara memakai plugin ini?"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-support.php:53
msgid ""
"The Guide & FAQ tab explains everything step by step, from creating the API "
"key to sending old orders and finding a missing one."
msgstr ""
"Tab Panduan & FAQ menjelaskan semuanya langkah demi langkah, mulai dari "
"membuat API key sampai mengirim pesanan lama dan mencari pesanan yang tidak "
"masuk."

#: includes/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:1047
msgid "The plugin does not send anything while \"Enable Integration\" is off."
msgstr "Plugin tidak mengirim apa pun selama \"Aktifkan Integrasi\" mati."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:733
msgid "Choose an order or type its number…"
msgstr "Pilih pesanan atau ketik nomornya…"

#. translators: %s: what the user typed
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:735
#, php-format
msgid "Use order number %s"
msgstr "Pakai nomor pesanan %s"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:736
msgid "Choose an order first."
msgstr "Pilih pesanan terlebih dahulu."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:737
msgid "Searching…"
msgstr "Mencari…"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:738
msgid "No order found. Type the order number to use it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan tidak ditemukan. Ketik nomor pesanannya untuk tetap memakainya."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:739
msgid "The list could not be loaded. Type the order number instead."
msgstr "Daftar tidak bisa dimuat. Ketik nomor pesanannya saja."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:99
msgid ""
"An order did not reach Kledo? Choose it below and run a diagnosis. The "
"plugin checks, step by step, everything that decides whether an order is "
"sent, and tells you the most likely cause. You can then download the report "
"and send it to the Kledo team."
msgstr ""
"Ada pesanan yang tidak masuk ke Kledo? Pilih pesanannya di bawah lalu "
"jalankan diagnosa. Plugin akan memeriksa satu per satu semua hal yang "
"menentukan apakah pesanan dikirim, lalu memberi tahu kemungkinan "
"penyebabnya. Setelah itu Anda bisa mengunduh laporannya dan mengirimkannya "
"ke tim Kledo."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:117
msgid ""
"Pick from the list — orders with a problem in Kledo come first — or search "
"by order number, customer name or email. You can also type an order number "
"that is not listed."
msgstr ""
"Pilih dari daftar — pesanan yang bermasalah di Kledo tampil paling atas — "
"atau cari berdasarkan nomor pesanan, nama, atau email pelanggan. Anda juga "
"bisa mengetik nomor pesanan yang tidak ada di daftar."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:314
msgid "Not in Kledo or failed"
msgstr "Belum ada di Kledo atau gagal"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-diagnostics.php:315
msgid "Recent orders"
msgstr "Pesanan terbaru"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:397
msgid ""
"Choose the order from the list — orders with a problem in Kledo are at the "
"top, and you can search by number, customer name or email, or type an order "
"number — then click \"Run diagnosis\". Eight checks run one by one: ✔ "
"passed, ⚠ warning, ✖ problem. Open \"Details\" on any of them to see more."
msgstr ""
"Pilih pesanan dari daftar — pesanan yang bermasalah di Kledo ada di paling "
"atas, dan Anda bisa mencari berdasarkan nomor, nama, atau email pelanggan, "
"atau mengetik nomor pesanan — lalu klik \"Jalankan diagnosa\". Delapan "
"pemeriksaan berjalan satu per satu: ✔ lolos, ⚠ peringatan, ✖ masalah. Buka "
"\"Detail\" di salah satunya untuk melihat lebih lengkap."

#. translators: %d: number of orders
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:272
#, php-format
msgid "%d order needs checking in Kledo"
msgid_plural "%d orders need checking in Kledo"
msgstr[0] "%d pesanan perlu dicek di Kledo"
msgstr[1] "%d pesanan perlu dicek di Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:412
msgid ""
"Open the API key page in Kledo with the button below (in Kledo: Settings › "
"Integrations › Developer & Security › API Key), and create a new API key for"
" WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Buka halaman API key di Kledo dengan tombol di bawah (di Kledo: Pengaturan ›"
" Integrasi › Developer & Keamanan › API Key), lalu buat API key baru untuk "
"WooCommerce."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:239
msgid ""
"In Kledo, open Settings › Integrations, then choose \"API Key\" in the "
"Developer & Security section. The button below opens that page directly."
msgstr ""
"Di Kledo, buka Pengaturan › Integrasi, lalu di bagian Developer & Keamanan "
"pilih \"API Key\". Tombol di bawah langsung membuka halaman tersebut."

#. translators: %d: number of orders
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:294
#, php-format
msgid "%d order not sent to Kledo yet"
msgid_plural "%d orders not sent to Kledo yet"
msgstr[0] "%d pesanan belum dikirim ke Kledo"
msgstr[1] "%d pesanan belum dikirim ke Kledo"

#. translators: %d: number of orders
#: includes/admin/class-wc-kledo-admin.php:296
#, php-format
msgid "%d order failed in Kledo"
msgid_plural "%d orders failed in Kledo"
msgstr[0] "%d pesanan gagal di Kledo"
msgstr[1] "%d pesanan gagal di Kledo"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:400
msgid ""
"If it is still not solved, click \"Download report\" and send the file to "
"Kledo, mentioning the report code (DIAG-…)."
msgstr ""
"Kalau masih belum beres, klik \"Unduh laporan\" lalu kirim file-nya ke Kledo"
" dengan menyebutkan kode laporannya (DIAG-…)."
